# 1. 把 .x 文件强制识别为 X language（会显示在语言栏里）
*.x linguist-language=Xlang

# 2. 如果你还想让它参与统计（推荐加上）
*.x linguist-detectable=true

# 3. Force LF for .x on all checkouts (Win autocrlf=true otherwise
#    yields CRLF; Win tip parser then mis-fires P012 on function-local
#    `let` as duplicate top-level — tip_win_l2_hello_fmt_grain 11.16).
*.x text eol=lf
